      "writtenOn": "2019-01-31T08:58:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this all we need to supply power to the USB port?\nAnswer：Yes, we only to pull up GPIO_NCP3902_EN_L and GPIO_EN_PP5000_USBC to supply power to the USB port.\n\nCan you explain how power flow is controlled by EN_N, RX_N, and FLAG_N?\nAnswer：In flapjack, we not used FLAG_N to contrl the OTG power supply and lead it floating. When OTG plugin we pullup EN_N,NCP3902 enter slave mode, and the RX_N is pull down by external pull-down resistor.\n\nAlso, can you clarify whether we\u0027re using autonomous mode or slave mode for NCP3902?\nAnswer: When OTG plugin NCP3902 enter slave mode and other scenes it is autonomous mode.\n\nThe truth table of NCP3902 opration see\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Z2eA2ENaoZIbg0bQM4GVzh_TYXGzVZKV-Rn1Fd3KCto/edit#gid\u003d1739821269",
      "parentUuid": "ac1e3d96_5277e339",
      "range": {
